{"ref":"BDB, יַעְזֵר²","hw":"יַעְזֵר²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַעְזֵר</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:66\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.66\">1 Ch 6:66</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.31\">26:31</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעְזֵיר</span> <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Ιαζηρ, E. of Jordan <strong>(Qal</strong> Impf. in—ִ according to Ba<sup>NB 104</sup><strong>)</strong>;—often + Heshbon and other important towns, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:32\" href=\"/Numbers.21.32\">Nu 21:32</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:24\" href=\"/Numbers.21.24\">24</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַז²\" href=\"/BDB,_עַז²\", dir=\"rtl\">עַז</a>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:1\" href=\"/Numbers.32.1\">32:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶרֶץ יַצ׳)</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:3\" href=\"/Numbers.32.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:35\" href=\"/Numbers.32.35\">35</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.5\">2 S 24:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:25\" href=\"/Joshua.13.25\">Jos 13:25</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:39\" href=\"/Joshua.21.39\">21:39</a> (Ginsb, v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:37\" href=\"/Joshua.21.37\">37</a> van d. H. Baer; P); with vineyards <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.8\">Is 16:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.9\">9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Je 48:32</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (where del. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם</span> before <span dir=\"rtl\">יַע׳</span> 𝔊 Hi Gf Gie Rothst). Site dub., cf. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 264</sup>.","next":"BDB, עזר","prev":"BDB, עַזְרִיקָם"}